--- a/docs/code-analysis--quality.md
+++ b/docs/code-analysis--quality.md
@@ -125,6 +125,7 @@ Servers focused on static analysis, linting, code metrics, security scanning, vu
 - [vostride/agent-qa](https://github.com/vostride/agent-qa): Self-improving agentic QA harness with a local MCP server for authoring, running, validating, and triaging natural-language web and mobile tests. Install: `npm install -D agent-qa`.
 - [autonomous-testing/wopee-mcp](https://github.com/autonomous-testing/wopee-mcp): AI testing agents for web apps — dispatch test runs, analysis crawls, and AI agent tests, fetch artifacts and project status.
 - [Aboudjem/sniff](https://github.com/Aboudjem/sniff): Autonomous QA and accessibility scanner that walks real user flows in a headless browser, reporting broken pages, dead links, console errors, and WCAG issues. Install with `npx -y sniff-qa --mcp`.
+- [GenClass](https://github.com/genclass-dev/GenClass): Helps a coding agent find race conditions in a web app: reads what happened in the app's development pages in causal order (clicks, requests, the order responses arrived, state writes, errors), re-runs a page with network responses delivered in different orders, replays one exact order to prove a fix and writes a Playwright regression test. The page side is two dev-only lines (`connectAgent` from `@genclass/runtime/agent`). Install: `npx -y @genclass/mcp@0.2.1`. Transport: stdio. Local by default: no auth, no account; the bridge listens on 127.0.0.1. 9 tools. Clients: Claude Code, Cursor, VS Code, Codex. License: Apache-2.0. [Docs](https://github.com/genclass-dev/GenClass/blob/main/packages/mcp/README.md).
 - [Aboudjem/ui-ux-suite](https://github.com/Aboudjem/ui-ux-suite): UI/UX design-audit server that scores a project across 12 dimensions including color contrast, typography, accessibility, layout, and spacing against WCAG 2.2 and APCA. Install with `npx -y ui-ux-suite`.
 - [snayyar00/webability-mcp](https://github.com/snayyar00/webability-mcp): Find and fix web accessibility (WCAG 2.2 AA, ADA, Section 508, EAA, AODA) issues from your coding agent — scan any URL/HTML with 3 engines (axe-core, HTML_CodeSniffer, and custom detectors), get framework-aware fixes, verify, run a vision audit, and generate auditor-ready reports. Install: `npx -y -p @webability/mcp webability-mcp`. Hosted HTTP also available at `https://mcp.webability.io/mcp`.
 - [Cranot/roam-code](https://github.com/Cranot/roam-code): Local-first MCP server with 116 tools for codebase intelligence — graph-aware retrieval (FTS5 + personalized PageRank + clones), patch verifier (clones-not-edited check), in-toto v1 Code Graph Attestation with cosign signing, OpenVEX-correct taint reachability, AIBOM extension (CycloneDX 1.7) for EU AI Act compliance. 27 languages, 33-tool core preset + dedicated 14-tool compliance preset. Zero API keys, 100% local SQLite.
